  "copyleft": "Three kinds of library here are under a licence that asks more than keeping the notice. (1) The GCC runtime library inside OpenBLAS (numpy, scipy): GPL 3 or later with the GCC Runtime Library Exception, which allows passing it on as part of a program built with GCC. (2) GNU libiconv (netCDF4, rasterio) and GEOS (rasterio): LGPL 2.1 or later; they are separate files, unchanged, and can be replaced by the user. (3) SpatiaLite and FreeXL (rasterio): a choice of three licences, taken here under the Mozilla Public License 1.1. The source of each is at the address given. Bohemian Wind's own code contains none of them and stays under the MIT licence."
